# Vite only exposes env vars prefixed VITE_ to client code, and it reads
# them at BUILD time (`npm run build`), not at runtime -- there is no
# server process for a static site to read a real env var from later.
# Locally: copy this file to `.env` and `npm run dev` picks it up.
# On Render: set this as a Build-time "Environment Variable" on the
# Static Site (see RENDER_REACT_DEPLOY.md) -- Render re-runs the build
# whenever it changes.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://investmentresearch.onrender.com
